  What a project should plan for when real boards arrive (details: DEVIATIONS.md):
    - hello.simulated becomes false and your SIM badge disappears by itself; nothing else changes.
    - no `pos` until the owner has set the anchor coordinates (anchors.calibrated == "none" until then).
    - two tags share air time (about half the rate each); status.battery may be empty; range.fp / los may be
      missing on some boards. Treat every optional field as optional.
    - keep a recorded session and your sim scenario as fallbacks: `--source replay:<file> --loop`.

